0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 528 Tm (Its DOCTOR script used pattern matching and scripted transformations) Tj ET
0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 512 Tm (to produce seemingly responsive conversation. It was influential) Tj ET
