0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 390 Tm (People may attribute understanding, empathy, or personality to) Tj ET
0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 374 Tm (a system because its replies seem personal or responsive.) Tj ET
0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 358 Tm (This tendency is called the "ELIZA effect.") Tj ET
0.06 0.33 0.43 rg BT /FB 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 334 Tm (Convincing dialogue alone is not evidence of genuine understanding.) Tj ET
1 1 1 rg 44 157 524 116 re f
