0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 212 Tm (1966: ELIZA showed how dialogue can shape human expectations.) Tj ET
0.13 0.19 0.26 rg BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 196 Tm (2026: NewBrain aims to test learning, memory, corrections and restart) Tj ET
